```console
$ scherzo-cloud project runner-pool --help
Manage a project's runner pool

Usage: scherzo-cloud project runner-pool [COMMAND]

Commands:
  set     Assign or replace a project's runner pool
  remove  Remove a project's runner pool
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
